        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"NAL0781\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/nal0781/48/2041_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> NAL0781:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Just listened to the segment on my lunch break. &nbsp;Sounds like Tom is planning to keep the game in his collection which is rare these days. <strong>&nbsp;He did say he plans to have a video review up this week if he can.</strong> &nbsp;I'll be interested to watch.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Tom's review is up on Youtube now. Off to watch it now.</p>",
