        "created_at": "2014-05-02T14:11:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Wrath + Claw = Win</p><p>That would be the entire body of the email haha</p><p>After playing another 2 player game last night with Tharendim and Folly against the Syndicate where we lost the round after we scrapped the flagship, a revenge game had to be played. Wrath +Claw. Cleared the board, then forced the flagship out just to scrap that as well. This was all elite mode. Wrath is too good for her own good I swear. Shes Team Leader Tachyon in the base set haha.</p>",
